vg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 7.6 8 2 2 7.6M3.6 8.4V14h3.2v-3.2h2.4V14h3.2V8.4"></path></svg></a><span>/</span><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white rounded-sm" href="/docs/community/community-intro">Community</a><span>/</span><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white rounded-sm" href="/guides">Guides</a></div><article><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-col sm:items-stretch sm:gap-4"><div class="max-w-xl 2xl:max-w-[520px]"><h1 class="text-[36px] leading-tight font-medium tracking-tighter text-balance md:text-[28px]">Creating a Content Moderation System with Laravel, OpenAI API, and Neon Postgres</h1><p class="mt-[1.125rem] text-xl leading-tight tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-40 dark:text-gray-new-70 md:mt-1.5 md:text-lg">Build an automated content moderation system for your application using Laravel Livewire, OpenAI&#x27;s moderation API, and Neon Postgres</p></div><div class="relative mt-2.5 w-fit sm:mt-0"><div class="flex items-center border border-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20"><button class="flex h-8 w-fit shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border-r border-gray-new-90 px-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-black-new hover:bg-gray-new-98 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-94 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="size-4 shrink-0"><g clip-path="url(#copy-docs_inline_svg__a)"><mask id="copy-docs_inline_svg__b" width="16" height="16" x="0" y="0" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" style="mask-type:luminance"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 0h16v16H0z"></path></mask><g stroke="currentColor" mask="url(#copy-docs_inline_svg__b)"><path d="M5.947 14.63h8.683V5.945H5.947z"></path><path d="M3.579 10.684H2V2h8.683v1.579"></path></g></g><defs><clipPath id="copy-docs_inline_svg__a"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 0h16v16H0z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><span class="text-sm leading-none tracking-extra-tight whitespace-nowrap">Copy page</span></button><button class="flex h-8 items-center px-1 hover:bg-gray-new-98 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 15" class="size-3.5 text-gray-new-50 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-new-50"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.5 5.75 7 9.25l3.5-3.5"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="prose-doc post-content prose dark:prose-invert xs:prose-code:break-words mt-10 lg:mt-7 md:mt-5"><p>Content moderation is essential for maintaining healthy online communities and platforms. In this guide, we&#x27;ll create a content moderation system that uses OpenAI&#x27;s moderation API to automatically analyze and flag potentially problematic content before it reaches your users.</p>
<p>We will use Laravel, OpenAI&#x27;s moderation API, and Neon&#x27;s serverless Postgres database and build a system that can handle content moderation for comments, forum posts, product reviews, or any user-generated content.</p>
<h2 id="what-youll-build" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>What You&#x27;ll Build</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#what-youll-build" aria-label="Link to What You&#x27;ll Build"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>In this guide, you&#x27;ll build a content moderation system with the following features:</p>
<ol>
<li>A form for users to submit content to our Neon database</li>
<li>Automatic content analysis using <a class="group inline" href="https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/moderation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenAI&#x27;s moderation API<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a></li>
<li>A moderation queue for reviewing flagged content</li>
<li>A dashboard for viewing moderation statistics</li>
<li>Settings management for different content types</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="prerequisites" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Prerequisites</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#prerequisites" aria-label="Link to Prerequisites"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>To follow the steps in this guide, you will need:</p>
<ul>
<li>PHP 8.2 or higher</li>
<li><a class="group inline" href="https://getcomposer.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Composer<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> installed</li>
<li>A <a class="group inline" href="https://console.neon.tech/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Neon<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> account</li>
<li>An <a class="group inline" href="https://platform.openai.com/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenAI<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> account with API access</li>
<li>Basic familiarity with Laravel and PHP</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="create-a-neon-project" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Create a Neon Project</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-a-neon-project" aria-label="Link to Create a Neon Project"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>Neon provides a serverless Postgres database that automatically scales as your application grows. Let&#x27;s set up a Neon database for our content moderation system:</p>
<ol>
<li>Navigate to the <a class="group inline" href="https://console.neon.tech/app/projects" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Projects<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> page in the Neon Console.</li>
<li>Click &quot;New Project&quot; and select your preferred settings.</li>
<li>Once your project is created, you&#x27;ll see the connection details. Save the connection string for later use.</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="set-up-a-laravel-project" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Set up a Laravel Project</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#set-up-a-laravel-project" aria-label="Link to Set up a Laravel Project"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
